 "notes": "Chinese groups by 万 (10^4) and 亿 (10^8): 10.7 billion is 107亿, and 1亿2000万 is read as one number. 应当 is shall in PRC standards, so it is must; should is 应该, 应, 宜 or 建议. 不得不 (have to) is must, not 不得. Number words (一 二 三) are not checked: they occur inside ordinary words. Number words 二 to 十 and 两 count only before a measure word (三个, 两种); 一 never counts, since 一个 is the article. 千 before 克, 米 or 字节 is a unit prefix, not a scale. Bare 万 and 亿 are not numbers of their own: they occur in ordinary words.",
